                "original_url": "https:\/\/www.sfpublicpress.org\/states-rent-relief-program-neglects-vulnerable-communities-groups-say\/",
                "fallback": "San Francisco Public Press: State’s Rent-Relief Program Neglects Vulnerable Communities, Groups Say - San Francisco Public Press",
                "text": "California’s program to alleviate rent debts — and prevent a wave of evictions in July — makes it tough for some of the state’s most vulnerable residents to request financial aid, community groups in San Francisco say. The way the system is designed prevents many people from applying, including those who live in informal housing arrangements, those who do not speak English and those who lack digital proficiency, according to staff at local organizations helping tenants and landlords file applications.",
                "title": "State’s Rent-Relief Program Neglects Vulnerable Communities, Groups Say - San Francisco Public Press",
                "title_link": "https:\/\/www.sfpublicpress.org\/states-rent-relief-program-neglects-vulnerable-communities-groups-say\/",
